<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Nautic Club</title>
    <style>
        body { 
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #6D28D9;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }
        .content {
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #F9FAFB;
            border: 1px solid #E5E7EB;
        }
        .footer {
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #6B7280;
            background-color: #F3F4F6;
            border-radius: 0 0 5px 5px;
        }
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #6D28D9;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="header">
        <h1>Welcome to Nautic Club!</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="content">
        <h2>Hello {{ recipient.firstName }},</h2>
        
        <p>Thank you for joining the Nautic Club community! We're excited to have you on board.</p>
        
        <p>With your membership, you'll enjoy:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Access to exclusive nautical events</li>
            <li>Priority registration for popular activities</li>
            <li>Regular updates on upcoming water sports opportunities</li>
            <li>Connection with other maritime enthusiasts</li>
        </ul>
        
        <p>To get started, visit your personalized dashboard:</p>
        
        <div style="text-align: center;">
            <a href="{{ dashboard_url|default('#') }}" class="button">Go to My Dashboard</a>
        </div>
        
        <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, feel free to reply to this email or contact our support team.</p>
        
        <p>
            Smooth sailing,<br>
            The Nautic Club Team
        </p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="footer">
        <p>© {{ current_year }} Nautic Club. All rights reserved.</p>
        <p>123 Ocean Drive, Beach City | <a href="mailto:info@nauticclub.com">info@nauticclub.com</a> | +1 234 567 890</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 